& [FSC2FinalSliceSurfaceV1] is the executable final-slice surface for FSC2 planning coordination
  + [chunk_ref] is FSC2 planning coordination
  + [chunk_boundary] is P4 whole-field planning and packetization, P7 coordination and multi-agent governance, and P8b readiness, packetization, completion-review, and coordination fixtures
  + [accepted_boundary_input] is docs/planning/FSC1_Foundation_Contract_Pack.v1.sop
  + [unresolved_external_dependency_set] is empty_after_gate
  + [current_ready_slice] is FSC2-S01
  + [gated_slice_set] is FSC2-S02, FSC2-S03, FSC2-S04, FSC2-S05, FSC2-S06, and FSC2-S07

  = must: execute FSC2-S01 before any other FSC2 slice
  = must: run completed-work review after each slice
  = must: stale downstream slices when an upstream output changes or contradicts the current slice assumptions
  = must: keep FSC3 through FSC5 gated until FSC2-S07 accepts the planning coordination pack

& [FinalWorkSlice: FSC2-S01-ImportedBoundaryAndInvariantMap] is ready
  + [slice_id] is FSC2-S01
