  + [authority_basis] is docs/canonical/LangSOP_FSC2_Final_Slices.canonical.sop
  + [boundary_input_set] is docs/planning/FSC1_Foundation_Contract_Pack.v1.sop
  + [internal_dependency_set] is empty
  + [expected_output_set] is docs/planning/FSC2_Boundary_And_Invariant_Map.v1.sop
  + [expected_output_set] is imported record-kind inventory, imported operator contract inventory, FSC2-owned invariant set, forbidden mutation list, and downstream stale trigger list
  + [verification_oracle] is all FSC1 imports are mapped without schema edits, runtime implementation, surface implementation, or dispatch authority
  + [model_route] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [model_route_reason] is boundary import determines which FSC2 duties may refine FSC1 contracts and which must remain forbidden
  + [forbidden_scope] is editing FSC1 outputs, finalizing readiness operator semantics, packet generation semantics, coordination conflict semantics, runtime graph code, surface rendering, and operations-manager work
  + [completion_review_required] is true

